ent-RUMCGeothermalGenerator = geothermal generator
    .desc = A boiler on a plate of heat-resistant alloy that makes power of the heat of the earth. Set it beside the lava of the black stone layer, and every piece of the lake within its reach gives it a share of the power, up to four.
ent-RUMCDieselGeneratorHeavy = heavy diesel generator
    .desc = A big diesel engine on a frame, with a tank of its own. It gives four times the power of the small generator and burns only twice the fuel. Pour diesel into it from a canister (or pipe it in), join a high voltage cable.
ent-RUMCBatteryBank = battery bank
    .desc = A big store of power for the high voltage line, many times the battery buffer. It takes in what the generators make beyond use and gives it back when they make less. Join it through a cable terminal, as a big SMES is.

au14-craft-recipe-buildgeothermalgenerator = Geothermal generator
au14-craft-recipe-builddieselgeneratorheavy = Heavy diesel generator
au14-craft-recipe-buildbatterybank = Battery bank

au14-source-examine = { $count } pieces of the source are within its reach: it gives { $power } W.
au14-source-examine-none = There is nothing within its reach to take power from.
